{"id":29649,"slug":"a-tale-of-winter","title":"A Tale of Winter","year":1992,"country":"France","duration":114,"spine":null,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/29649-a-tale-of-winter","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/7da990defb4abe4f07049c0162dcc9a2/QdccXsmWXCFEf8tyjivheK7pQcZio1_large.jpg","description":"The second Four Seasons tale made by Eric Rohmer is among the most spiritual and emotional films of his storied career. Five years after losing touch with Charles (Frédéric van den Driessche), the love of her life and the father of her young daughter, Félicie (Charlotte Véry) attempts to choose between librarian Loïc (Hervé Furic), who lives in the Parisian suburbs, and hairdresser Maxence (Michel Voletti), who has recently moved to the central French town of Nevers. In the midst of indecision, Félicie holds to an undying faith that a miracle will reunite her with Charles, a faith that Rohmer examines in all of its religious and philosophical dimensions.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Eric Rohmer","slug":"eric-rohmer"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Charlotte Véry","role":"Félicie","slug":"charlotte-very"},{"actor":"Frédéric van den Driessche","role":"Charles","slug":"frederic-van-den-driessche"},{"actor":"Hervé Furic","role":"Loïc","slug":"herve-furic"},{"actor":"Michel Voletti","role":"Maxence","slug":"michel-voletti"},{"actor":"Ava Loraschi","role":"Élise","slug":"ava-loraschi"},{"actor":"Christiane Desbois","role":"The mother","slug":"christiane-desbois"},{"actor":"Rosette","role":"The sister","slug":"rosette"},{"actor":"Jean-Luc Revol","role":"The brother-in-law","slug":"jean-luc-revol"},{"actor":"Haydée Caillot","role":"Edwige","slug":"haydee-caillot"},{"actor":"Jean-Claude Biette","role":"Quentin","slug":"jean-claude-biette"},{"actor":"Marie Rivière","role":"Dora","slug":"marie-riviere"},{"actor":"Claudine Paringaux","role":"Customer","slug":"claudine-paringaux"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Eric Rohmer","slug":"